  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里究竟是什么地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”终成眷属……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 08 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}疼死了……什么啊，\n最后还真是掉下来啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}还“看来”呢！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}居然选我当一个男人的命定伴侣，\n你肯定搞错了吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}搞错了还装傻，\n你到底受过什么教育啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}哇……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦，这就说完了！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}我才不要啊！\n当这家伙命中注定的另一半什么的！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}在这种梦幻的地方独处，\n我都要哭出来了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}想哭的是我才对{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 01 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}又不会把你吃掉{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}别说想哭啊，装什么可爱！\n很吓人啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}我又没觉得你会吃我！\n这个比喻才吓人啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}话说你真的是高２？\n完全不像和我同岁啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……不过这么说的话，桐条学姐和荒垣学长\n也不像只比我大１岁……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_301.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}算了……虽然搞不清楚，\n总之也只能往前走了吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]